<title>USA: Mills holds 5.1 pct Koger Equity stake.</title>
<headline>Mills holds 5.1 pct Koger Equity stake.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-08-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mills Value Adviser Inc said Wednesday it holds a 5.1 percent stake in Koger Equity Inc or 902,500 common shares.</p>
<p>In a filing with the Securities and Exchange Commission, Mills said it bought the stake between June 12 and August 13 at prices ranging from $12.85 to $15.01 per share.</p>
</text>
